od","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","review_id":"FaxA9wfcXp4QInEo0I0hKw","date":"2014-01-05T14:18:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9412323832511902,"text_excerpt":"Went here to watch Saints/Eagles and celebrate my birthday. It belongs in the discussion of notable New Orleans restaurants with its interesting array of seafood appetizers and entrees. I've dined here several times in the past two years and have enjoyed most aspects of the meal. Specifically, the salad and oyster appetizers are very good. Each of us had the black drum with crab meat on top. It was a good size portion of fish that we couldn't finish. Not overlooked or over seasoned which some restaurants tend to do. The beer/wine selection is nice with lots of local/regional brews available on tap. We had the pudding for dessert that was pretty amazing based on the waiter's suggestion. I ..."},{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","review_id":"eRYHwWCl11NmP6PAwKjqfw","date":"2014-05-02T16:09:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9365048408508301,"text_excerpt":"We went to Borgne because my two favorite Besh restaurants were booked (Luke and August). The atmosphere is loud but very modern and trendy-ish looking. They have an excellent beer selection, mostly bottled but their draft selection isn't bad either. Our food and service was all very good. We shared the broiled oysters, gulf fish, gumbo, and Caesar salad between the two of us were more than satisfied. My only thing with Borgne, while everything was solid, is that it's somewhat forgettable among the restaurant scene in New Orleans. As a resident I'm confident I would go to other places to eat depending on my mood, but as a visitor staying in the Hyatt Regency (which is where the restaurant..."},{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","review_id":"rR3R_KmdP7B8TQliSXPFcw","date":"2018-10-01T16:17:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9287000894546509,"text_excerpt":"Surprisingly the food was great here. I'm hesitant about eating at hotels I stay at. I usually don't think it's good. But this place was wonderful! The service can be a bit faster. The free bread and butter that came free was the greatest butter I have ever tasted along with the freshly baked bread, still steaming when your year the bread apart. The fried seafood platter was a good choice, you can taste a bit of everything. The decoration using the empty oyster shells was a pleasant touch !"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","photo_id":"NE3HXh_RIEU7GtQeLuOoiA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/NE3HXh_RIEU7GtQeLuOoiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8786288499832153},{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","photo_id":"nqpkbweBqipdADSMayzdQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nqpkbweBqipdADSMayzdQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8427031636238098},{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","photo_id":"qTYBt8AbT2A4mkZoKDcvnQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qTYBt8AbT2A4mkZoKDcvnQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8116625547409058},{"business_id":"RPEMUwN_CDRRToQ_7hxsvA","photo_id":"0IumBoCVJwSbnaT9lF_wyQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0IumBoCVJwSbnaT9lF_wyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8004774451255798},{"business_id":